    "title": "Philips 43\" Class 7875 Series 4K UltraHD Ambilight Roku Smart TV",
    "description": "The Philips 43\" Class 7875 Series is a 4K UltraHD Roku Smart TV designed for an immersive viewing experience. It features proprietary Ambilight technology, which uses rear LEDs to project color-matching light onto the wall behind the screen, extending the on-screen action into the room. The TV boasts a 4K resolution (3840 x 2160) with HDR10 for rich color and contrast, and a 60Hz refresh rate paired with Philips Perfect Motion Rate for smooth visuals during fast-paced content. Powered by the Roku OS, it provides seamless access to streaming apps like Netflix and Disney+, and is compatible with Alexa, Google Assistant, Siri, and Apple AirPlay. For audio, it includes a 2-channel speaker system with Dolby Audio support.",
